\title{unbiasedgoodness: Goodness-of-Fit Tests After Model Selection}
\description{
Provides goodness-of-fit tests for linear models chosen by data-driven model selection. Typical model diagnostics are biased when computed on the same data used to select the model. The package tests a selected model against a data-driven enlargement of it, either with selective (truncated) F and chi tests after forward stepwise selection, or with residual prediction tests after lasso selection, and includes tools for simulating the selective error rates of these tests.
